# -F / --form is multipart upload. The parser does not yet model it
# precisely (file fields, ;type= / ;filename= modifiers, comma-separated
# multi-file, --form-string semantics), so vet refuses to run rather
# than mis-vet a request that could exfiltrate /etc/passwd via
# `-F file=@/etc/passwd`.
-F
upload=@./photo.png
https://api.example.test/upload
